CODEGEN.md §2.7: a cycle of records through fields only, its optional field boxed, still meets gen/cpp's class order when the record holding the box is declared first (gen/cpp: "a type that holds itself"), so refusedRecords stays reachable without a stored method (DECISIONS 284 moved those to cyclicFn); its kind is RecordFieldCycle (DECISIONS 292).
